    <sanctionEntity designationDate="2026-10-08" designationDetails="" unitedNationId="" euReferenceNumber="EU.15043" logicalId="186049">
        <remark>Olga Alekseevna Belyavtseva is a Russian businesswomen, entrepreneur, and owner of companies Agronom-Sad, Biplast, Assol, Everest and Evermount Capital Group. Her companies are active in the agriculture, manufacturing, finance, consulting, construction and real estate sectors. According to her own words, her company Agronom-Sad occupies a leading position in the agricultural sector in Russia and has received subsidies from the Russian government.Therefore, Olga Alekseevna Belyavtseva is a leading businessperson operating in Russia and a businessperson involved in economic sectors providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.</remark>
